# A call longer than the desk: its question scrolls above the choices, which stay in view.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies calls-tall.json
project storefront shop
chat Wren
title "Show the returns policy"
say "Add the returns policy to the checkout"
settle 8
front Wren
settle 2
click "Which returns policy should the checkout show?"
settle 2
snap calls-tall
move 912,300
scroll -400
settle 1
snap calls-tall-scrolled
key cmd-k
settle 2
snap calls-tall-alone
